<title>GERMANY: Pan-German final March CPI inflation +1.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Pan-German final March CPI inflation +1.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN CPI INFLATION		  March 97    Feb 97  March 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.2	  +0.4	 +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.5	  +1.7	 +1.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    117.9	 118.1	116.2</p>
<p> FINAL WEST GERMAN CPI INFLATION   March 97   Feb 97   March 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.1	  +0.3	 unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.6	  +1.7	 +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    115.5	 115.6	113.7</p>
<p> EAST GERMAN CPI INFLATION	   March 97   Feb 97   March 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.1	  +0.4	 +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year			    +1.6	  +1.7	 +2.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    137.4	 137.5	135.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets.  </p>
<p>The Office gave the following details on pan-German CPI:</p>
<p>					    Mth/mth	     Yr/yr</p>
<p>					March 97 Feb 97   March 97 Feb 97</p>
<p> Food, drink, tobacco	     -0.2    +0.2	+0.7    +1.2</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes		    +0.1    unch	+0.6    +0.6</p>
<p> Rents &amp; energy		     -0.1    unch	+2.6    +2.8</p>
<p> Of which: rents		    +0.1    +0.3	+2.8    +2.8</p>
<p>	     energy excl. fuel    -1.3    -1.1	+1.8    +3.0</p>
<p> Furniture, household goods     unch    +0.1	+0.5    +0.5</p>
<p> Health and body care goods     unch    +0.9	+2.0    +2.3</p>
<p> Traffic and news transmission  +0.1    +0.1	+0.7    +0.8</p>
<p> Education, leisure goods	 unch    unch	+2.5    +2.5</p>
<p> Personal equipment, others     -1.0    +4.0	+2.5    +2.4</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
